# Similar Agricultural Rover Projects

This document lists real-world projects that inspired the design of our Smart Agriculture Rover.

## 1. TerraSentia Agricultural Robot
Autonomous crop monitoring rover developed by EarthSense.
https://earthsense.co/terrasentia/

## 2. Bonirob Precision Agriculture Robot
A field robot designed for crop monitoring and weed detection.
https://www.bosch.com/stories/bonirob/

## 3. Small Robot Company – Tom Robot
An AI-powered robot used to scan farmland and analyze crop health.
https://www.smallrobotcompany.com/

## 4. Hands Free Hectare Project
A fully autonomous farming project developed by Harper Adams University.
https://www.handsfreehectare.com/

## 5. Agricultural Monitoring Robot Research
Research on autonomous robots for crop and soil monitoring.
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/
